WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:08.382
Emmy and Harry were playing with friends.

2
00:00:08.383 --> 00:00:12.215
They were all playing in the tree house.

3
00:00:12.216 --> 00:00:18.338
Oliver wanted to play too.

4
00:00:18.339 --> 00:00:23.290
"Not now," the older kids said.

5
00:00:23.291 --> 00:00:34.652
"No fair!" Oliver said.

6
00:00:34.653 --> 00:00:38.276
"Let's have a club," Harry said.

7
00:00:38.277 --> 00:00:41.494
"Good idea," Emmy said.

8
00:00:41.495 --> 00:00:46.040
"What should we call it?"

9
00:00:46.041 --> 00:00:49.097
Jim grinned at Harry.

10
00:00:49.098 --> 00:00:53.827
"Let's call it the Boys Only Club!"

11
00:00:53.828 --> 00:00:58.316
"No fair!" Emmy said.

12
00:00:58.317 --> 00:01:02.156
Sarah grinned at Emmy.

13
00:01:02.157 --> 00:01:06.130
"We can have our own club, Emmy.

14
00:01:06.131 --> 00:01:11.323
We'll call it the No Boys Allowed Club."

15
00:01:11.324 --> 00:01:18.272
"No fair!" Harry said.

16
00:01:18.273 --> 00:01:21.806
"Time for lunch," Mom called.

17
00:01:21.807 --> 00:01:24.139
Emmy looked at Harry.

18
00:01:24.140 --> 00:01:27.805
"Who plays in the tree house after lunch?"

19
00:01:27.806 --> 00:01:34.496
"The club that gets there first!" Harry said.

20
00:01:34.497 --> 00:01:40.885
The kids ate lunch.

21
00:01:40.886 --> 00:01:48.339
The girls and boys finished at the same time.

22
00:01:48.340 --> 00:01:51.342
Then they raced to the tree house.

23
00:01:51.343 --> 00:01:55.671
They all got there at the same time.

24
00:01:55.672 --> 00:01:58.551
"Uh-oh," Jim said.

25
00:01:58.552 --> 00:02:10.758
"Someone is already in the tree house."

26
00:02:10.759 --> 00:02:13.359
It was Oliver!

27
00:02:13.360 --> 00:02:20.674
"I have a club too," he said.

28
00:02:20.675 --> 00:02:26.379
"Can Sarah and I be in your club?" Emmy asked.

29
00:02:26.380 --> 00:02:32.794
"Can Jim and I be in your club?" Harry asked.

30
00:02:32.795 --> 00:02:39.449
Oliver grinned. "My club is fair," he said.

31
00:02:39.450 --> 00:02:51.276
"It's for everybody!"

